{
  "_about": "Model-visible size of tool results (CONTRACT section 4.5), measured on the decoded body. `results` are tool-result/v1 replies with their exact size; `legacy` are legacy-format bodies (any reply not decoded as tool-result/v1). JSON values count by their RFC 8785 (JCS) length. `boundary` cases build a one-part text reply from `text_unit` repeated `repeat` times, so the file stays small; `over` says whether it exceeds the inclusive 65,536-byte limit.",
